{"4559400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Like or Die", "steam_appid": 4559400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The stream is about to go live.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quaya Stream is waiting for you to launch your channel. If you're ready to take center stage with </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the entire universe watching, add Like or Die to your wishlist now. It's time to go live.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/3ea0287cd9330a2ced6dc8a3bc77784a.avif?t=1787686235\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras_big/3ea0287cd9330a2ced6dc8a3bc77784a.webp?t=1787686235 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Viewers from across the universe are waiting for your live stream.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This live broadcast features 16 streamers split into 4 teams, streamed in real-time to an audience spanning the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cosmos. Rack up 'LIKE's with your epic plays, survive until the end, and become Quaya’s ultimate star streamer.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/ee154d9bdac9c68b6135f2a785c16e98.poster.avif?t=1787686235\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/ee154d9bdac9c68b6135f2a785c16e98.webm?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/ee154d9bdac9c68b6135f2a785c16e98.mp4?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn the tide of battle with blocks.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Block Gun to spawn cube blocks anywhere you desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build defensive barriers to protect your Nexus, or carve out new entry routes to catch the enemy off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you reshape the battlefield is entirely up to you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/a0e2ffb63fc2f89c2dd06f6603dca652.poster.avif?t=1787686235\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/a0e2ffb63fc2f89c2dd06f6603dca652.webm?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/a0e2ffb63fc2f89c2dd06f6603dca652.mp4?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destroy the Nexus and stop enemy respawns.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as the Nexus—the source of respawning—remains intact, you can jump back onto the stage even if you fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the moment the Nexus goes down, respawns are gone for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Nexuses collapse one by one, the broadcast reaches a fever pitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your team’s Nexus and destroy the enemy’s Nexus to be the last team standing.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/0128895c1db4bf691b232327b5b87d12.poster.avif?t=1787686235\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/0128895c1db4bf691b232327b5b87d12.webm?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/0128895c1db4bf691b232327b5b87d12.mp4?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather resources and secure sponsor supplies.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure resources across the arena to purchase more powerful weapons and items, boosting your team's combat power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredible power lies hidden inside the airdrops and Lucky Blocks sent by your sponsors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you spend your resources and which supplies you fight for—your calls will make or break your team.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/8eb2acf53e1c170841d33fbcba94031a.poster.avif?t=1787686235\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/8eb2acf53e1c170841d33fbcba94031a.webm?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/8eb2acf53e1c170841d33fbcba94031a.mp4?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Viewers from across the universe are waiting for your live stream.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This live broadcast features 16 streamers split into 4 teams, streamed in real-time to an audience spanning the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cosmos. Rack up 'LIKE's with your epic plays, survive until the end, and become Quaya’s ultimate star streamer.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/ee154d9bdac9c68b6135f2a785c16e98.poster.avif?t=1787686235\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/ee154d9bdac9c68b6135f2a785c16e98.webm?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/ee154d9bdac9c68b6135f2a785c16e98.mp4?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn the tide of battle with blocks.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Block Gun to spawn cube blocks anywhere you desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build defensive barriers to protect your Nexus, or carve out new entry routes to catch the enemy off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you reshape the battlefield is entirely up to you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/a0e2ffb63fc2f89c2dd06f6603dca652.poster.avif?t=1787686235\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/a0e2ffb63fc2f89c2dd06f6603dca652.webm?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/a0e2ffb63fc2f89c2dd06f6603dca652.mp4?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destroy the Nexus and stop enemy respawns.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as the Nexus—the source of respawning—remains intact, you can jump back onto the stage even if you fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the moment the Nexus goes down, respawns are gone for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Nexuses collapse one by one, the broadcast reaches a fever pitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your team’s Nexus and destroy the enemy’s Nexus to be the last team standing.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/0128895c1db4bf691b232327b5b87d12.poster.avif?t=1787686235\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/0128895c1db4bf691b232327b5b87d12.webm?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/0128895c1db4bf691b232327b5b87d12.mp4?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather resources and secure sponsor supplies.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure resources across the arena to purchase more powerful weapons and items, boosting your team's combat power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredible power lies hidden inside the airdrops and Lucky Blocks sent by your sponsors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you spend your resources and which supplies you fight for—your calls will make or break your team.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/8eb2acf53e1c170841d33fbcba94031a.poster.avif?t=1787686235\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/8eb2acf53e1c170841d33fbcba94031a.webm?t=1787686235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559400/extras/8eb2ac